From f31f50abececdb5ddd28603ffc52a76bcf5cc9eb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: YeonGyu-Kim <code.yeon.gyu@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Mar 2026 13:52:57 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 3287/5749] fix(release): revert package identity to
 oh-my-opencode

Keep installer, config detection, schema generation, and publish workflows aligned with the long-lived oh-my-opencode package so this release does not split across two npm names.

Ultraworked with [Sisyphus](https://github.com/code-yeongyu/oh-my-openagent)

Co-authored-by: Sisyphus <clio-agent@sisyphuslabs.ai>
---
